@startuml
title CON-SD-D12 Post-Restoration Reconciliation Lifecycle
skinparam shadowing false

start
:Restoration signal or deactivation decision;
:Disable or limit continuity-only workflows;
:Collect continuity-origin activity set;
:Review activation/deactivation and incident scope;
:Compare payment/provider/fiscal/fiscal-reference records;
:Review projection/degraded basis and vendor acknowledgment outcomes;
:Review gate outcomes, manual releases, and discount activity;
:Operator Console governance review;
:Management Dashboard visibility / backlog labels;
if (All required items reconciled and approved?) then (yes)
  :Close / reconciled under approved authority;
else (no)
  :Keep open / escalate unresolved items;
endif
stop

note right
Returning to normal operation does not close continuity-origin records.
Projection cannot close financial or fiscal reconciliation.
end note
@enduml
